OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788606030
OL,3,CBreakdancer Raygun reacts to
OL,4,C'conspiracy theories and bullying' in
OL,5,Cdocumentary
OL,7,FMs Gunn scored zero points at the 2024
OL,8,FParis Olympic Games for her kangaroo-
OL,9,Fhopping performance, which sparked a
OL,10,Fwave of memes and online jokes, but
OL,11,Falso raised questions about her
OL,12,Fselection for the Australian squad.
OL,14,FAn anonymous online petition attacking
OL,15,FGunn and claiming she had
OL,16,F"manipulated" Olympic qualification
OL,17,Fprocesses received nearly 50,000
OL,18,Fsignatures at the time.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788606030
OL,3,CBreakdancer Raygun reacts to
OL,4,C'conspiracy theories and bullying' in
OL,5,Cdocumentary
OL,7,FThe Australian Olympic Committee (AOC)
OL,8,Fsaid the petition was "vexatious,
OL,9,Fmisleading and bullying".
OL,11,FAt the time, Ms Gunn, who has a PhD in
OL,12,Fbreakdancing and dance culture,
OL,13,Fresponded to the public outcry and
OL,14,Fsaid she did not realise her dance
OL,15,Fwould "open the door to so much hate".
OL,26,@pD@WOUqD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
