OL,3,CBreakdancer Raygun reacts to
OL,4,C'conspiracy theories and bullying' in
OL,5,Cdocumentary
OL,7,FDespite coming last at the Olympics,
OL,8,Fthe World DanceSport Federation (WDSF)
OL,9,Franked her world number one
OL,10,Fbreakdancer.
OL,12,FAsked about the origins of her iconic
OL,13,Fmoves, Ms Gunn told GMB she trained
OL,14,Fhard for seven months before
OL,15,Fqualifying for the competition,
OL,16,Fincorporating "a lot more dynamic
OL,17,Fmoves" and "power moves".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
