PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1788606030
OL,3,CBreakdancer Raygun reacts to
OL,4,C'conspiracy theories and bullying' in
OL,5,Cdocumentary
OL,7,FWhen she realised she could be
OL,8,Fcompeting in the semis and the final,
OL,9,Fshe said she needed to develop a "new
OL,10,Fstrategy".
OL,12,F"Creativity is one of the categories
OL,13,Fthat they judge, so that's one of my
OL,14,Fstrengths. So, you know, together with
OL,15,Fmy partner, Sammy, we used some
OL,16,FAustralian inspiration and put
OL,17,Ftogether some well-known moments," the
OL,18,Fbreakdancer explained.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
